  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Set at the Nouveau Port in Cavalaire, La Suite serves world cuisine with Italian influences, in an air-conditioned setting extended by a large terrace with harbour views. Pets are welcome, making it a handy address if you want to dine on the terrace watching the boats, with your dog at your feet.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>Budget around €21-30 for the meal. The air-conditioned dining room is a real plus on hot days, and the available wifi lets you extend your stay if needed. The terrace overlooking the harbour is especially pleasant in the evening.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: if you'd rather have the cool of the air-conditioned dining room than the terrace in high summer, ask for an indoor table — the setting is just as pleasant.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Cavalaire harbour and its promenade are right nearby, perfect for a digestive walk with your dog before or after the meal.</p>
